# Hippiatrica Berolinensia - English translation, batch 43
# global indices 2671-2735 (65 items)
# Section: close of "eileōdes" (prognosis by ear/breath/sweat signs) ->
# further eileōdes remedies -> "On sycamine (mulberry) poisoning" -> "On a
